    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-τλητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having borne much,
				miserable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέροντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				354
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.135
			</span></i>, al.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠδίνεσσι πολυτλήτοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					11.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.341
				</span></i>
			.</div>
